{"t":"Behemoth Quest","s":"behemoth-quest-953f7","k":"quest","i":"assets/wiki/Behemoth_Quest_Map_1_5078ae.png","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Behemoth Quest</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Guardian Halberd Quest, Cyclopolis Quest</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">80<br/>(80 recommended)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.2<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 16, 2003<br/>Christmas Update 2003</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p class=\"no-results\">This quest has no legend.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a> (<a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclopolis\">Cyclopolis</a>)\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclops%20Drone\">Cyclops Drones</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclops%20Smith\">Cyclops Smiths</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Guard\">Dwarf Guards</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Soldier\">Dwarf Soldiers</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Elemental\">Fire Elementals</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragons</a> and a <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord\">Dragon Lord</a> on the way to the quest.\n4 <a href=\"#/wiki/Behemoth\">Behemoths</a>, 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclops%20Smith\">Cyclops Smiths</a> and 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragons</a> in the quest room.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Demon%20Shield\">Demon Shield</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Golden%20Armor\">Golden Armor</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Guardian%20Halberd\">Guardian Halberd</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Amulet\">Platinum Amulet</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Life%20Ring\">Life Ring</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Ring\">Crystal Ring</a>, 3 <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Diamond\">Small Diamonds</a>, 4 <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Sapphire\">Small Sapphires</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-quest-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>The level requirement for this quest was changed from 60 to 80 in late 2004 or in the beginning of 2005.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Requirements\">Requirements</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Destroy%20Field%20Rune\">Destroy Field Runes</a> (at least 1, more recommended).</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Method\">Method</span></h2>\n<p>Go north of <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a> to <a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclopolis\">Cyclopolis</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33250,31698,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33250, 31698, 7)</a>). Follow the maps below to reach the 5th floor of <a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclopolis\">Cyclopolis</a>, with the <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragons</a>. You can use <a href=\"#/wiki/Stealth%20Ring\">Stealth Ring</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Invisible\">Invisible</a> and run through the Cyclopes, but <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Elemental\">Fire Elementals</a> on the lower floors will see you.\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"12ea7d4cce9687dba8efaafceb48a049\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:154px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Behemoth_Quest_Map_1-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:152px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"Start Destination\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption='&lt;span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #ffff00; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Start&lt;br /&gt;&lt;span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #00ff00; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Destination' height=\"152\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Behemoth_Quest_Map_1_5078ae.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Behemoth Quest Map 1.png (3 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\"><span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #ffff00; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"></span> Start<br/><span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #00ff00; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"></span> Destination</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:154px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Behemoth_Quest_Map_2-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:151px; width:185px; top:0.5px;\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"152\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Behemoth_Quest_Map_2_1e4ba5.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Behemoth Quest Map 2.png (3 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:154px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Behemoth_Quest_Map_3-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:143px; width:175px; top:4.5px;\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"143\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Behemoth_Quest_Map_3_1c6e15.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Behemoth Quest Map 3.png (2 KB)\" width=\"175\"/></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:154px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Behemoth_Quest_Map_4-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:151px; width:185px; top:0.5px;\"><img alt=\"Level 30 Door of Expertise.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption='&lt;span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #ff0000; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Level 30 .' height=\"151\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Behemoth_Quest_Map_4_8b295c.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Behemoth Quest Map 4.png (3 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\"><span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #ff0000; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"></span> Level 30 <a href=\"#/wiki/Gate%20of%20Expertise\">Door of Expertise</a>.</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:154px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Behemoth_Quest_Map_5-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:107px; width:131px; top:22.5px;\"><img alt=\"Lever to remove rocks (explained later).\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption='&lt;span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #ff0000; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Lever to remove rocks (explained later).' height=\"107\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Behemoth_Quest_Map_5_030f45.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Behemoth Quest Map 5.png (2 KB)\" width=\"131\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\"><span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #ff0000; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"></span> Lever to remove rocks (explained later).</div></div></div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Floor</th>\n<th>Be prepared to face</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-1</td>\n<td>Many <a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclops\">Cyclopes</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclops%20Drone\">Cyclops Drones</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Soldier\">Dwarf Soldiers</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Guard\">Dwarf Guards</a>, and possibly a lured <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Leader\">Orc Leader</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Berserker\">Orc Berserker</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Mage\">Minotaur Mage</a> and/or <a href=\"#/wiki/Elf%20Arcanist\">Elf Arcanist</a>.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-2</td>\n<td>Many <a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclops\">Cyclopes</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclops%20Drone\">Cyclops Drones</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclops%20Smith\">Cyclops Smiths</a>, and <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Soldier\">Dwarf Soldiers</a>.\n </td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-3</td>\n<td>Many <a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclops\">Cyclopes</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclops%20Drone\">Cyclops Drones</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclops%20Smith\">Cyclops Smiths</a>, and a <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Elemental\">Fire Elemental</a>.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-4</td>\n<td>Many <a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclops\">Cyclopes</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclops%20Drone\">Cyclops Drones</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclops%20Smith\">Cyclops Smiths</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Elemental\">Fire Elementals</a>.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-5</td>\n<td>3 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragons</a>, 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Elemental\">Fire Elementals</a>, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord\">Dragon Lord</a> (cavern).</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Go down again and you will see an impressive overview of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Behemoth\">Behemoth</a> floor. Go north behind the stairs and find a spot to levitate down to a small platform with 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclops\">Cyclopes</a>, approximately <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33296,31689,13\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33296, 31689, 13)</a>. On this platform, go to the northern edge and look north for large rocks. If there are no large rocks, you can skip the next part.\n</p><p>Go back south and levitate up to the platform you came from. Go east and down the staircase. Go all the way west and half way south to reach the next staircase. Go up, and follow either path to the south-eastern staircase. Go up, kill the <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord\">Dragon Lord</a> and use a <a href=\"#/wiki/Destroy%20Field%20Rune\">Destroy Field Rune</a> on the tile furthest west of the northern corridor row (see image). You may have to move corpses to find the lever. When the lever is to the right, backtrack to the rocks for the next step.\n</p><p>Go down the stairs on the platform and kill the <a href=\"#/wiki/Behemoth\">Behemoths</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Soldier\">Dwarf Soldiers</a> and Cyclopes that spawn by the stairs. Go north through the narrow passage and up the stairs. Go through the level 80 <a href=\"#/wiki/Gate%20of%20Expertise\">Door of Expertise</a> and prepare yourself for the final room.\n</p><p>In the final room there are 4 <a href=\"#/wiki/Behemoth\">Behemoths</a>, 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclops%20Smith\">Cyclops Smiths</a>, and 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragons</a>. There are many viable strategies. Druids may use manashield and \"stair hop\" using <a href=\"#/wiki/Eternal%20Winter\">Eternal Winter</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Avalanche\">Avalanche</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Sudden%20Death%20Rune\">Sudden Death Runes</a>. Sorcerers can do the same but with <a href=\"#/wiki/Rage%20of%20the%20Skies\">Rage of the Skies</a>. Knights can use <a href=\"#/wiki/Berserk\">Berserk</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Fierce%20Berserk\">Fierce Berserk</a>. Paladins can use <a href=\"#/wiki/Divine%20Caldera\">Divine Caldera</a> but killing them 1-on-1 would probably be more efficient with the help of <a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Wall%20Rune\">Energy Wall Runes</a>. A <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarven%20Ring\">Dwarven Ring</a> is recommended as the <a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclops%20Smith\">Cyclops Smiths</a> can make you drunk. You may also ask a higher level for help.\n</p><p>When the room is clear you will find your rewards in the northern end of the room.\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"1\" hash=\"5422fb39d1c11a9dfff7325bd252fcc4\" id=\"w-gallery-1\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:154px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Behemoth_Quest_Levitate-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:151px; width:185px; top:0.5px;\"><img alt=\"Use Levitate here to go to the lower platform.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Use  here to go to the lower platform.\" height=\"152\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Behemoth_Quest_Levitate_a1f6ca.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Behemoth Quest Levitate.png (155 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Use <a href=\"#/wiki/Levitate\">Levitate</a> here to go to the lower platform.</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:154px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Behemoth_Quest_Rocks-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:151px; width:185px; top:0.5px;\"><img alt=\"If the rocks exist, you need to pull the lever.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"If the rocks exist, you need to pull the lever.\" height=\"152\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Behemoth_Quest_Rocks_8e7e8f.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Behemoth Quest Rocks.png (211 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">If the rocks exist, you need to pull the lever.</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:154px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Behemoth_Quest_Lever-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:152px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"Make sure the lever points to the right.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Make sure the lever points to the &lt;b&gt;right&lt;/b&gt;.\" height=\"152\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Behemoth_Quest_Lever_bf9825.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Behemoth Quest Lever.png (107 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Make sure the lever points to the <b>right</b>.</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>","quests":["measuring-tibia-quest"]}